Package: icons-streamline-vectors
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         iconlibutils
Description: Streamline vector icon collections
 Streamline vector icon collections
 .
 Provides icon assets under /usr/share/icons-streamline-vectors, a preview index, and a
 launcher `icons-streamline-vectors` (`iconlibutils -l streamline-vectors`).

